    player "别太在意，你开心的话，我不介意你暂时离开。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:374
translate chinese_simp luna_date_two_dee3c3fa:

    # luna "I appreciate that-"
    luna "谢谢——"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:377
translate chinese_simp luna_date_two_a18056fc:

    # luna "But I'm even happier when you're here with me..."
    luna "但你在我身边的时候我才是最开心的……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:378
translate chinese_simp luna_date_two_793280f8:

    # player "How about we both make sure we 'visit' each other more often~"
    player "不如我们都多‘看看’对方~"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:381
translate chinese_simp luna_date_two_d1b61a14:

    # luna "That sounds like a plan!"
    luna "这主意不错！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:389
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_2ed7da54:

    # think "Recently, all she does is sleep..."
    think "最近她除了睡觉还是睡觉……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:390
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_c9ae2f36:

    # think "Kinda like she's making up for the past 20 or so years- Or it's just the boredom of not having anything to do."
    think "就好像在弥补过去那二十年——又或者只是太闲了没事干。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:391
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_9d78a09b:

    # think "Maybe I could do something for her... I should ask [astra] about a way for her to somehow experience the real world."
    think "也许我可以为她做点什么……我应该问问 [astra] 有没有办法让她体验一下现实世界。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:395
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_c2ec8b6f:

    # player "Do you remember the voice inside my head I told you about a while ago?"
    player "你还记得我之前跟你提过的，我脑海里的那个声音吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:398
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_ac450abe:

    # astra "Of course I remember. It was giving you advice, right?"
    astra "当然记得。它会给你建议，对吧？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:399
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_9e2bf745:

    # player "Yes, but she's much more than just that."
    player "对，但它远不止是那样。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:402
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_a8c8e68c:

    # astra "She?"
    astra "她？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:403
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_40caebd5:

    # player "Yeah. She's got a whole personality, feelings, thoughts, everything."
    player "对。她有自己的性格、情感、想法，什么都有。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:406
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_86d2b3b9:

    # astra "Interesting..."
    astra "有意思……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:409
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_25c4c41e:

    # astra "Take a seat. Let me see if I can feel her inside you now."
    astra "坐下吧。让我看看能不能感觉到她就在你体内。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:412
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_465a007c:

    # astra "Hmm... I don't detect anything wrong or different."
    astra "嗯……我没感觉到任何异常或不同。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:413
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_fcc68923:

    # player "She's sleeping right now. Could that hide her or something?"
    player "她正在睡觉。这会不会把她藏起来了？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:416
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_f3bf8aac:

    # astra "No, even when she's sleeping, she's still there, right?"
    astra "不会，就算她睡着了，她也在那里，对吧？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:417
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_b69f3f3e:

    # player "Yeah... So what does this mean now?"
    player "对……那现在这意味着什么？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:420
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_006187ed:

    # astra "I'm not sure."
    astra "我也不确定。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:421
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_da51033a:

    # player "Is there a way for her to get her own body, even temporarily?"
    player "有没有办法让她拥有自己的身体，哪怕只是暂时的？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:424
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_0a9dca97:

    # astra "I could build one, but moving her in there would be a different story."
    astra "我可以造一个，但把她移进去就是另一回事了。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:425
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_a85cc4ca:

    # astra "I would need to be able to detect her first."
    astra "我得先能探测到她才行。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:426
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_69d365c5:

    # player "But would it be possible?"
    player "但有可能做到吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:429
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_59c94f08:

    # astra "Yes. Almost everything is possible, just maybe not with my magic."
    astra "可以。几乎一切皆有可能，只是光靠我的魔法可能不够。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:430
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_e6f11a5b:

    # astra "But we can worry about that later. First, I'll build a body for her."
    astra "但那个可以晚点再说。我先给她造个身体。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:433
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_c4bae108:

    # astra "Are there any requirements I should keep in mind?"
    astra "有什么需要我特别注意的要求吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:434
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_be89d1c0:

    # player "Not really..."
    player "没什么特别的……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:435
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_37035835:

    # player "Her eyes are green, and her hair is dark. For everything else, I'll let you decide."
    player "她眼睛是绿色的，头发是深色的。其他方面你来定吧。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:438
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_2ab62df7:

    # astra "Okay, I can work with that..."
    astra "好，足够了……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:441
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_bcc38308:

    # astra "It should only take me a few weeks. Once it's ready, I'll come look for you."
    astra "应该只需要几周时间。准备好了我就来找你。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:442
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_badf8829:

    # player "Okay, that sounds good. Thank you."
    player "好，那就这么说定了。谢谢你。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:445
translate chinese_simp luna_body_one_a8e4c829:

    # think "I'll keep this a secret for now. Better to surprise her when more is ready."
    think "先保密吧。等一切就绪再给她个惊喜。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:459
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_42de2d44:

    # player "Come in!"
    player "请进！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:463
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_307e80fb:

    # astra "Hey! I just finished making the body!"
    astra "嘿！身体我刚造好了！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:464
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_813dd977:

    # player "Wait, didn't you say it would take a few weeks?"
    player "等等，你不是说要几周吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:467
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_77d06148:

    # astra "Yes, but it took two weeks for me~!"
    astra "对啊，但对我来说过了两周~！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:468
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_607aa1fe:

    # player "Oh right... the time speed thing."
    player "哦对……时间流速的事。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:471
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_055f0f04:

    # astra "Yep~! So... do you want to see it?"
    astra "没错~！所以……你想看看吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:472
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_69441823:

    # player "Of course."
    player "当然。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:476
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_1e10bcfe:

    # player "[luna]'s asleep again, so this is the perfect time to get everything planned."
    player "[luna] 又睡着了，正是计划一切的好时机。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:477
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_32a360b9:

    # astra "Alright, are you ready?"
    astra "准备好了吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:478
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_3a9397d8:

    # player "Yeah, let's see it."
    player "嗯，看看吧。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:481
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_ab47c79b:

    # player "Woah!"
    player "哇！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:484
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_9ef9c748:

    # astra "Is something wrong?"
    astra "怎么了？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:487
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_a36d0569:

    # player "You really went all out on the... proportions..."
    player "你在这……比例上……真是下足了功夫……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:490
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_43c6baf2:

    # astra "Well, you said you'd leave it up to me... I went with a body that's got plenty of things to hold and play with~"
    astra "嗯，你说让我来决定……我就选了个‘手感’好的，有很多可以抓和玩的地方~"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:491
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_1c0be38f:

    # player "I don't know if [luna]'s going to see it that way..."
    player "我不知道 [luna] 会不会这么看……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:494
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_79f95b81:

    # astra "I'm sure she won't mind~! But before that, we need to figure out a way to actually move her into it."
    astra "我相信她不会介意的~！但在这之前，我们得想办法把她移进去。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:495
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_1ccdf8d9:

    # player "Actually, before we do that, you should find some clothes for her."
    player "实际上，在那之前，你应该先给她找些衣服。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:498
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_82973ee8:

    # astra "Alright, alright, I'll handle that. She'll be all covered up next time you come here."
    astra "好好好，我来搞定。你下次来的时候她会有衣服穿的。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:499
translate chinese_simp luna_body_two_80cd5a9a:

    # player "Great. I'll be back as soon as [luna] wakes up, so get her dressed quickly!"
    player "太好了。[luna] 一醒我就回来，你尽快给她穿好！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:508
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_545ed05b:

    # luna "Hey, you came to visit again!"
    luna "嘿，你又来看我了！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:509
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_652104a0:

    # player "Yeah, I've actually been here a few times recently, but you were always asleep."
    player "嗯，其实最近我来过几次，但你都在睡觉。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:512
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_d901782c:

    # luna "Oh... sorry about that. I'm awake now. Is there something you need me for?"
    luna "哦……抱歉。我现在醒了。有什么事需要我吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:513
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_e7308eaf:

    # player "Yes, I want to show you something."
    player "嗯，我想给你看样东西。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:516
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_206fffc1:

    # luna "Oh? Show {i}me{/i}?"
    luna "哦？给 {i}我{/i} 看？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:517
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_17be8fe0:

    # player "Yes. Let's go."
    player "对。走吧。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:521
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_2faf0455:

    # player "[luna]'s awake and she wants to see it."
    player "[luna] 醒了，她想看看。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:522
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_0ee9c1c5:

    # luna "'See it'? I'm so confused!"
    luna "“看看”？我好困惑！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:525
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_ba35142f:

    # astra "Alright, follow me."
    astra "来，跟我来。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:528
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_887f03b5:

    # luna "Who's she?"
    luna "她是谁？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:529
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_abffd176:

    # player "Well, no one. It's just a body that [astra] made."
    player "嗯，不是谁。这只是 [astra] 造的一个身体。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:532
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_15a6f47b:

    # astra "It will hopefully be a vessel if we can figure out how to move you into it."
    astra "如果我们能想办法把你移进去，它就能成为你的容器。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:533
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_e4642cd5:

    # luna "Permanently?"
    luna "永久性的？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:534
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_f1bb1934:

    # player "From everything I've heard, this would be a very temporary thing."
    player "据我所知，这会是暂时的。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:537
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_acceca35:

    # astra "Exactly. You're deep in [player]'s head, so moving you permanently would be nearly impossible from my point of view."
    astra "没错。你深植在 [player] 的脑海里，要从我这里永久转移你几乎不可能。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:540
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_8e0a8a4d:

    # astra "You would be able to use the body for a few hours at a time, or longer if you're close to [player]."
    astra "你一次能使用这个身体几个小时，如果靠近 [player] 的话时间能更长一些。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:541
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_5c3c2467:

    # luna "That's good... So... how does this work?"
    luna "那还好……所以……这具体怎么操作？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:542
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_0be2f4cf:

    # player "She's asking how this works."
    player "她在问怎么操作。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:545
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_c5adbb57:

    # astra "Honestly, I'm not sure. This isn't the kind of magic I can do."
    astra "老实说，我也不确定。这不是我擅长的魔法。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:548
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_b2722675:

    # astra "If this is done, it would have to be you, [player]."
    astra "如果要做到，恐怕得靠你，[player]。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:549
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_a15a47b9:

    # player "Me? How? I can't use magic..."
    player "我？怎么弄？我又不会魔法……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:552
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_c93990b1:

    # astra "True, but don't you have an elf living in your house?"
    astra "没错，但你家里不是住着一个精灵吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:553
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_32fe5085:

    # player "[ellie]? Yes... so?"
    player "[ellie]？是有……然后呢？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:556
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_7f7d39e4:

    # astra "If you tame her, you'll be able to use magic. It would still take a lot of practice to actually learn it, but you'd at least have the ability."
    astra "如果你驯服她，你就能使用魔法了。虽然真的学会需要大量练习，但至少你有了那个能力。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:557
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_3ffc4ff8:

    # player "That's... not as simple as you make it sound. [ellie]'s just gotten free from being tamed. I don't know how she'd feel about this..."
    player "这……没你说得那么简单。[ellie] 刚摆脱驯兽身份，我不知道她会怎么想……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:558
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_ce81f660:

    # player "Basically being used for her magic again."
    player "她大概会感觉又被利用来获取魔法了。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:561
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_ed74f260:

    # astra "I get it, but it's the only way I can think of right now."
    astra "我明白，但这是我目前能想到的唯一办法。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:562
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_7e5bc5b7:

    # player "Alright... I'll talk to her. I'll explain the whole thing and see what she says."
    player "好吧……我去找她谈谈。我会把整件事都告诉她，看她怎么说。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:565
translate chinese_simp luna_body_three_04ee70c0:

    # astra "Good! I'll have the body ready and waiting!"
    astra "好！我会把身体准备好等着！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:577
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_b8acda6f:

    # player "Can we talk for a moment? I have a huge favor to ask..."
    player "能跟你聊几句吗？我想请你帮个忙……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:578
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_cd3cbb43:

    # ellie "Oh- Sure..."
    ellie "哦——可以啊……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:579
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_d04cf996:

    # player "Well... there's a problem I'm dealing with, and to solve it, I'd need to use magic. The kind of magic you're able to use..."
    player "嗯……我遇到个问题，要解决它我需要用到魔法。就是你用的那种……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:582
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_3f568652:

    # ellie "Oh... okay... ...so..."
    ellie "哦……好吧……所以……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:585
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_262d436b:

    # ellie "You... want to tame me... for my magic?"
    ellie "你……想驯服我……为了我的魔法？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:586
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_1c6c3d91:

    # player "I guess-"
    player "可以这么说——"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:589
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_78ac068a:

    # ellie "Is that... the only reason?"
    ellie "这……是唯一的原因吗？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:590
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_f3bab46b:

    # player "Uh... What do you mean?"
    player "呃……你指的是什么？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:593
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_7a715bb8:

    # ellie "Is there another reason you want to tame me? Because... I don't want to be used like that again."
    ellie "除了这个，你还有什么理由想驯服我吗？因为……我不想再被那样利用了。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:597
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_42ef24f5:

    # think "That's fair..."
    think "这话在理……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:598
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_5d8d590e:

    # ellie "I want you to find a different reason!"
    ellie "我要你找到别的理由！"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:599
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_a4a54bd2:

    # luna "She just wants you to actually want to tame her..."
    luna "她只是希望你是真心想驯服她……"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:600
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_b11d8297:

    # think "Yeah, that's obvious now. I guess I should give her a bit and then try a different approach."
    think "嗯，这下很明显了。我想我应该放一放，然后换个方式试试。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:601
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_4dac68af:

    # luna "That sounds like a good idea. Besides, I'm fine waiting. I like where I am anyway."
    luna "这主意不错。而且我不介意等，反正我也挺喜欢现在这样的。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:602
translate chinese_simp luna_body_four_9e19a3bb:

    # luna "But do come visit me soon. I have something for you."
    luna "不过记得早点来看我，我有东西给你。"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:612
translate chinese_simp luna_body_five_dc56b318:

    # player "You said you had something for me?"
    player "你说有东西要给我？"

# game/scripts/Characters/luna.rpy:613
translate chinese_simp luna_body_five_88fbba94:

    # luna "Yes, please, sit."
